  "note": "Strip verification (CLAUDE.md rule 4; PRD P0-6 'EXIF/GPS stripped on ingest'). Every image here is synthetic: gradients drawn by scripts/knotwork/gen-photo-fixtures.ts, with invented metadata. For each file: its type by magic bytes, the size its header states, what the inspector finds in it BEFORE, what the pipeline answers, and what the inspector finds in the stored renditions AFTER. `npm run fixtures:check` recomputes every expect block from the committed files.",
